<blockquote class="bigquote">
<p>
Fathers and teachers, I ask myself: &ldquo;What is hell?&rdquo; And I answer thus: &ldquo;The suffering of being no longer able to love.&rdquo;
</p>
</blockquote>

<p class="bigquote">
Fyodor Dostoevsky
</p>


